\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Ye faithful souls who Jesus know,
\par If risen indeed with Him ye are,
\par Superior to the joys below,
\par His resurrection's power declare.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Your faith by holy tempers prove,
\par By actions show your sins forgiven,
\par And seek the glorious things above,
\par And follow Christ, your Head, to heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. There your exalted Saviour see,
\par Seated at God's right hand again,
\par In all His Father's majesty,
\par In everlasting pomp to reign.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. To Him continually aspire,
\par Contending for your native place;
\par And emulate the angel choir,
\par And only live to love and praise.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. For who by faith your Lord receive,
\par Ye nothing seek or want beside;
\par Dead to the world and sin ye live,
\par Your creature-love is crucified.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Your real life, with Christ concealed,
\par Deep in the Father's bosom lies;
\par And, glorious as your Head revealed,
\par Ye soon shall meet Him in the skies.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

